<h4>Session & storage</h4>${sw('restore', 'Restore open windows after reload')}<div class=row>Saved in this browser<span>${(Object.keys(localStorage).reduce((a, k) => a + k.length + localStorage[k].length, 0) / 1048576).toFixed(2)} MB (limit about 5 MB)</span></div><button class=g onclick="localStorage.removeItem('emos_sess');ntf('Saved session cleared')">Forget saved session</button>
